  "name": "The Sleeping Ox",
  "description": "Bead mw-ju8.6: Briar Glen's inn in grey box, built from the e00 kit only. A 10 x 8 m common room (street door in the south wall, a long bar counter with Odette \"Dot\" Farrow behind it, a hearth, lanterns, two tables with benches) and, through an open doorway in the east wall, a rented 4 x 4 m room with a bed. Open-topped like every kit scene; furniture is kit stand-ins with named marker spawns so art can dress them later (mw-e24.4 builds the full inn). The bar opens the shop screen for merchant sleeping-ox (tag merchant:<id>, verb talk): Buy and Sell for food, and on the Services tab a room for the night, which charges the crowns, sleeps until morning (06:00), fully restores health, stamina and mana and autosaves. dev-crowns:400 tops the player up on first opening so the dev scene can trade. Reach it with ?scene=sleeping-ox; its street-exit transition leads out to briar-glen-lane (mw-e01.11); the lane's sleeping-ox-door leads in (mw-ju8.22), arriving at arrive-from-briar-glen-lane just inside the street door.",
